<title>TURKEY: Turkey may export durum later in year - official.</title>
<headline>Turkey may export durum later in year - official.</headline>
<dateline>ANKARA 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turkey's state grain board (TMO) might export an unspecified amount of durum wheat later this year, a grain official said.</p>
<p>&quot;We have about 450,000 tonnes of durum wheat from the purhcases from farmers so far this year. We may export some of it later,&quot; said the official.</p>
</text>
